<div class="level">
  <div class="level-left">
    <h1 class="title level-item">Troubleshoot</h1>
  </div>
</div>

<p class="content">
  The first steps of <code>docs/TROUBLESHOOTING.md</code>, without the
  <code>ssh</code>. The flow tester answers <em>should this work</em> from the
  configuration; it does not send a packet.
</p>

<h2 class="title is-5">Flow tester</h2>
<p class="content is-small has-text-grey">
  Walks a packet through the same rules the renderers emit — client
  <code>AllowedIPs</code>, cryptokey routing, the proto-158 routes, and the
  <code>inet naaf</code> forward chain — and reports which line decided it.
</p>

<form method="get" action="/troubleshoot/flow"
      hx-get="/troubleshoot/flow" hx-target="#flow-result" hx-swap="innerHTML"
      hx-disabled-elt="find button">
  <div class="field is-grouped is-grouped-multiline">
    <div class="control">
      <label class="label">From</label>
      <input class="input" type="text" name="src" value="<%= h(request.params["src"].to_s) %>"
             placeholder="<%= h(@settings[:server_ip].to_s.sub(/\.1\z/, ".2")) %>" required>
    </div>
    <div class="control">
      <label class="label">To</label>
      <input class="input" type="text" name="dst" value="<%= h(request.params["dst"].to_s) %>"
             placeholder="192.168.1.10" required>
    </div>
    <div class="control">
      <label class="label">Protocol</label>
      <div class="select">
        <select name="proto">
          <% Naaf::App::FLOW_PROTOS.each do |proto| %>
            <option value="<%= proto %>"<%= " selected" if request.params["proto"] == proto %>><%= proto %></option>
          <% end %>
        </select>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="control">
      <label class="label">Port</label>
      <input class="input" type="number" name="dport" min="1" max="65535"
             value="<%= h(request.params["dport"].to_s) %>" placeholder="443">
      <p class="help">Ignored for ICMP.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="field">
    <div class="control">
      <button class="button is-primary" type="submit">Trace</button>
      <span class="naaf-busy ml-2 is-size-7 has-text-grey">working…</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</form>

<div id="flow-result" class="mt-4">
  <%= render("troubleshoot/flow", locals: {report: @report, error: @flow_error}) %>
</div>
